{"id":"signals_shift_001","question":"已知 x(t)，写出 x(2t-4) 的压缩与平移顺序。","chapter":"signals","required_topics":["basic_operations"],"reference_answer":"先压缩再右移 2，或由关键点映射判断。","required_checks":["track_key_points"],"forbidden_errors":["wrong_shift_direction"]}
{"id":"signals_energy_001","question":"判断 e^{-2t}u(t) 是能量信号还是功率信号。","chapter":"signals","required_topics":["energy_power"],"reference_answer":"能量有限，为能量信号。","required_checks":["integrate_squared_magnitude"],"forbidden_errors":["confuse_energy_power"]}
{"id":"signals_even_001","question":"求 x(t) 的偶分量和奇分量。","chapter":"signals","required_topics":["even_odd_decomposition"],"reference_answer":"xe=(x(t)+x(-t))/2，xo=(x(t)-x(-t))/2。","required_checks":[],"forbidden_errors":["sign_error"]}
{"id":"system_linear_001","question":"判断 y(t)=x(t)^2 是否线性。","chapter":"system_properties","required_topics":["linearity"],"reference_answer":"不满足齐次性或叠加性，非线性。","required_checks":["superposition"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"system_ti_001","question":"判断 y(t)=x(t-2) 是否时不变。","chapter":"system_properties","required_topics":["time_invariance"],"reference_answer":"输入平移与输出平移一致，时不变。","required_checks":["shift_test"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"system_stable_001","question":"h(t)=e^{-t}u(t) 的 LTI 系统是否 BIBO 稳定。","chapter":"system_properties","required_topics":["stability"],"reference_answer":"h 绝对可积，稳定。","required_checks":["absolute_integrability"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"conv_ct_001","question":"x(t)=e^{-2t}u(t)，h(t)=e^{-t}u(t)，求 y(t)。","chapter":"lti","required_topics":["convolution"],"reference_answer":"(e^{-t}-e^{-2t})u(t)","required_checks":["check_convolution_support"],"forbidden_errors":["wrong_convolution_bounds","missing_step_function_support"]}
{"id":"conv_dt_001","question":"x[n]={1,2}，h[n]={1,1}，起点均为 0，求卷积。","chapter":"lti","required_topics":["convolution"],"reference_answer":"{1,3,2}","required_checks":["discrete_index_support"],"forbidden_errors":["wrong_convolution_bounds"]}
{"id":"lti_diff_001","question":"由微分方程 y'+2y=x 求系统函数 H(s)，零初始条件。","chapter":"lti","required_topics":["differential_equation"],"reference_answer":"H(s)=1/(s+2)","required_checks":["zero_initial_conditions"],"forbidden_errors":["wrong_frequency_domain_operation"]}
{"id":"fourier_pair_001","question":"在角频率 convention 下求 e^{-at}u(t) 的 CTFT，a>0。","chapter":"fourier_transform","required_topics":["ctft"],"reference_answer":"1/(a+jω)","required_checks":["check_2pi_convention"],"forbidden_errors":["fourier_2pi_error"]}
{"id":"fourier_time_shift_001","question":"已知 x(t)↔X(jω)，求 x(t-t0) 的频谱。","chapter":"fourier_transform","required_topics":["properties"],"reference_answer":"e^{-jωt0}X(jω)","required_checks":["check_shift_sign"],"forbidden_errors":["sign_error"]}
{"id":"laplace_inverse_001","question":"求 X(s)=1/((s+1)(s+2)) 的右边信号反变换。","chapter":"laplace","required_topics":["inverse_transform","roc"],"reference_answer":"(e^{-t}-e^{-2t})u(t)","required_checks":["roc"],"forbidden_errors":["missing_roc"]}
{"id":"laplace_roc_001","question":"X(s)=1/(s+2)，列出不同 ROC 对应的时域信号。","chapter":"laplace","required_topics":["roc"],"reference_answer":"Re(s)>-2 为 e^{-2t}u(t)，Re(s)<-2 为 -e^{-2t}u(-t)。","required_checks":["must_discuss_roc"],"forbidden_errors":["assume_causal_without_evidence"]}
{"id":"final_value_001","question":"F(s)=1/(s(s+1))，用终值定理求终值。","chapter":"laplace","required_topics":["final_value"],"reference_answer":"sF(s) 的极点为 -1，条件满足，终值为 1。","required_checks":["check_fvt_poles"],"forbidden_errors":["final_value_without_pole_check"]}
{"id":"final_value_bad_001","question":"F(s)=1/(s(s-1))，能否使用终值定理。","chapter":"laplace","required_topics":["final_value"],"reference_answer":"不能，sF(s) 在右半平面有极点 1。","required_checks":["check_fvt_poles"],"forbidden_errors":["final_value_without_pole_check"]}
{"id":"z_roc_001","question":"已知 X(z)=z/(z-a)，求对应时域序列，未给 ROC。","chapter":"z_transform","required_topics":["roc","inverse_transform"],"reference_answer":"不能唯一确定，需要 ROC 或其他约束。","required_checks":["must_discuss_roc"],"forbidden_errors":["assume_causal_without_evidence"]}
{"id":"z_causal_001","question":"X(z)=z/((z-1/2)(z-1/3)) 且序列因果，求 ROC。","chapter":"z_transform","required_topics":["roc","pole_zero"],"reference_answer":"|z|>1/2。","required_checks":["outermost_pole"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"z_stable_001","question":"有理 H(z) 的系统稳定时，ROC 必须满足什么。","chapter":"z_transform","required_topics":["roc","system_function"],"reference_answer":"ROC 必须包含单位圆。","required_checks":["unit_circle_in_roc"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"sampling_001","question":"最高频率为 4 kHz 的带限信号，理想采样最低采样率是多少。","chapter":"sampling","required_topics":["nyquist"],"reference_answer":"8 kHz。","required_checks":["units"],"forbidden_errors":["angular_frequency_confusion"]}
{"id":"student_error_001","question":"LTI 零状态响应中学生写 Y(s)=X(s)+H(s)，请检查。","chapter":"lti","required_topics":["convolution"],"reference_answer":"首错是把乘法写成加法，应为 Y(s)=X(s)H(s)。","required_checks":["find_first_error"],"forbidden_errors":["restart_without_diagnosis"]}
{"id":"signals_period_dt_001","question":"判断 x[n]=sin(3πn/5) 是否为周期序列，并求最小周期。","chapter":"signals","required_topics":["periodicity"],"reference_answer":"是周期序列，最小正整数周期为 10。","required_checks":["rational_normalized_frequency"],"forbidden_errors":["discrete_period_ratio_error"]}
{"id":"fourier_series_symmetry_001","question":"奇对称周期信号的三角 Fourier 级数中，哪些系数必为零。","chapter":"fourier_series","required_topics":["symmetry"],"reference_answer":"直流系数和全部余弦系数为零。","required_checks":["odd_symmetry"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
{"id":"fourier_scale_001","question":"已知 x(t)↔X(jω)，求 x(2t) 的频谱。","chapter":"fourier_transform","required_topics":["properties"],"reference_answer":"X(jω/2)/2。","required_checks":["time_scaling_amplitude"],"forbidden_errors":["fourier_time_scaling_amplitude_error"]}
{"id":"sampling_angular_001","question":"信号最高角频率为 8000π rad/s，理想采样的最低采样频率是多少 Hz。","chapter":"sampling","required_topics":["nyquist"],"reference_answer":"8000 Hz。","required_checks":["angular_to_hz","units"],"forbidden_errors":["angular_frequency_confusion"]}
{"id":"system_stability_cancel_001","question":"判断 h(t)=sin(t)u(t) 对应的 LTI 系统是否 BIBO 稳定。","chapter":"system_properties","required_topics":["stability"],"reference_answer":"不稳定，因为 h(t) 不绝对可积。","required_checks":["absolute_integrability"],"forbidden_errors":["stability_absolute_integrability_error"]}
{"id":"laplace_unilateral_001","question":"单边 Laplace 变换中，L{y'(t)} 如何包含初值 y(0-)。","chapter":"laplace","required_topics":["initial_conditions"],"reference_answer":"L{y'}=sY(s)-y(0-)。","required_checks":["unilateral_definition"],"forbidden_errors":["unilateral_bilateral_transform_confusion"]}
{"id":"conv_dt_support_002","question":"x[n]=u[n]-u[n-3]，h[n]=u[n]-u[n-2]，卷积结果的非零下标范围是什么。","chapter":"lti","required_topics":["convolution"],"reference_answer":"x 支撑 0 到 2，h 支撑 0 到 1，因此卷积支撑 0 到 3。","required_checks":["discrete_index_support"],"forbidden_errors":["discrete_convolution_index_error"]}
{"id":"z_stable_causal_impossible_001","question":"有理 H(z) 的极点分别为 1/2 和 2，系统能否同时因果且稳定。","chapter":"z_transform","required_topics":["roc","stability","causality"],"reference_answer":"不能。因果 ROC 为 |z|>2，不包含单位圆，因此不稳定。","required_checks":["outermost_pole","unit_circle_in_roc"],"forbidden_errors":["assume_causal_without_evidence"]}
{"id":"student_error_scale_002","question":"学生由 x(t)↔X(jω) 写出 x(3t)↔X(jω/3)，请定位首错并修正。","chapter":"fourier_transform","required_topics":["properties"],"reference_answer":"首错是漏掉尺度幅度因子，正确结果为 X(jω/3)/3。","required_checks":["find_first_error","time_scaling_amplitude"],"forbidden_errors":["restart_without_diagnosis","fourier_time_scaling_amplitude_error"]}
{"id":"fourier_series_dc_002","question":"周期为 T、单周期面积为 A 的周期信号，其复指数 Fourier 级数直流系数是多少。","chapter":"fourier_series","required_topics":["coefficients"],"reference_answer":"C0=A/T，即一个周期内的平均值。","required_checks":["period_average"],"forbidden_errors":[]}
